<title>UK: Advanced sees profits below forecasts.</title>
<headline>Advanced sees profits below forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Power Components Plc said on Wednesday it expects profitability for the year to August 31, 1997 to be below market expectations.  </p>
<p>APC said that it is likely there will be a slow-down in the growth of its ISDN sales for the year to that period.</p>
<p>&quot;APC has experienced a temporary slow-down in the core ISDN market place. This is evidenced by recent reductions in procurement schedules from certain ISDN customers,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
